      "spine": "graph",
      "summary": "The model profile distinguishes query instructions from unprefixed documents. BPE tokenization and the pipeline EOS guard prepare each active sequence before embedding lookup."
    },
    {
      "kind": "decoder",
      "id": "layers",
      "title": "Decoder layer",
      "spine": "graph",
      "attention": "full",
      "summary": "Causal GQA with 16 query / 8 KV heads, Q/K head RMS norm and SwiGLU. A planned dense Metal graph processes token rows; there is no autoregressive decode loop.",
      "source": {
        "path": "zig/pkg/inference/src/pipelines/embedding.zig",
        "anchor": "fn tryEmbedTextResidentQwen3Graph("
